    title: "The Story of Sickness: Improving Children's Sick Face Perception",
    authors: "Tiffany S. Leung, <strong>Guangyu Zeng</strong>, Sarah E. Maylott, Arushi Malik, Shuo Zhang, Krisztina V. Jakobsen, Elizabeth A. Simpson",
    venue: "Infant and Child Development, 34(3), e70024",
    url: "https://doi.org/10.1002/icd.70024",
  },
  {
