    type: "Journal Article",
    title: "Emerging Adults Mirror Infants’ Emotions and Yawns",
    authors: "Tiffany S. Leung, <strong>Guangyu Zeng</strong>, Sarah E. Maylott, Arushi Malik, Shuo Zhang, E. C. McNamara, Krisztina V. Jakobsen, Elizabeth A. Simpson",
    venue: "Developmental Psychobiology, 66(6), e22539",
